@orderUrl = http://localhost:12001
@accessToken = replace-with-an-access-token
@campaignId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@orderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@idempotencyKey = buyer-42-phone-001-20260906

### Submit a flash-sale order; repeat with the same key to receive the same order id
POST {{orderUrl}}/api/flash-sales/{{campaignId}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1,
  "paymentMethod": "Alipay"
}

### Poll the existing order workflow until Confirmed or Cancelled
GET {{orderUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Error path: missing Idempotency-Key returns validation problem details
POST {{orderUrl}}/api/flash-sales/{{campaignId}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 1,
  "paymentMethod": "Alipay"
}
